                            {
                                "example_id": "97ddc779-72ba-436f-83be-72c0671247a6",
                                "sense_id": "bde2b831-a37d-3751-8dd4-9e88c7313264",
                                "text": "Сильне́е всех мои́ми привя́занностями овладе́л, впро́чем, ста́рый ме́льник, де́душка Илья́ — соверше́нно седо́й стари́к с пребольши́ми чёрными уса́ми.",
                                "translation": "The strongest of all my attachments, however, was to an old miller, Grandpa Ilya—a completely white-haired old man with huge black mustaches.",
                                "english": "The strongest of all my attachments, however, was to an old miller, Grandpa Ilya—a completely white-haired old man with huge black mustaches."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
